Package: popart
Type: Package
Title: Population-Augmented Analysis of Randomized Trials
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person(
    given = "PopART",
    family = "Team",
    email = "popart.package@example.com",
    role = c("aut", "cre")
  )
Author: PopART Team [aut, cre]
Maintainer: PopART Team <popart.package@example.com>
Description: Fits g-formula, inverse probability weighted, and augmented
    inverse probability weighted estimators using randomized-trial and
    auxiliary target-population samples. Highly adaptive lasso models estimate
    the shared nuisance functions.
